OL,3,AMan About the House star Richard
OL,4,AO'Sullivan dies aged 82
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Richard O'Sullivan, whose roles
OL,7,Fincluded Robin Tripp in 1970s TV
OL,8,Fsitcoms Man About the House and Robin's
OL,9,FNest, has died aged 82.
OL,11,FHe was also known for starring in
OL,12,FDoctor at Large, Dick Turpin, and the
OL,13,F1980s sitcom Me and My Girl, alongside
OL,14,FTim Brooke-Taylor, Joanne Ridley and
OL,15,FJoan Sanderson.
OL,17,FO'Sullivan died surrounded by close
OL,18,Ffamily at Brinsworth House, the Royal
OL,19,FVariety Charity's care home, in west
OL,20,FLondon where he had lived for 23 years.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
