OL,3,AMan About the House star Richard
OL,4,AO'Sullivan dies aged 82
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Giles Cooper of the
OL,7,FRoyal Variety said: "Richard O'Sullivan
OL,8,Fwas a master of effortless charm and
OL,9,Fimpeccable comic timing, bringing pure
OL,10,Fwarmth, wit, and unforgettable joy to
OL,11,Fmillions of living rooms as a true
OL,12,Fgiant of British television."
